---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="Terms of Use" description="The terms for using hazirminds.ai, including the website AI assistant, our content and pricing statements.">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) clamp(24px,4vw,48px) clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">Terms of Use</span></nav>
<header style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:clamp(40px,6vw,64px)">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">Legal</p>
<h1 style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Terms of Use</h1>
<p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;text-wrap:pretty">The rules for using hazirminds.ai. If you become a client, your Master Services Agreement governs our services.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#585E5A"><span>Effective date: Oct 12, 2026</span></div>
</header>
<div style="display:flex;gap:clamp(40px,6vw,96px);align-items:flex-start">
<aside class="hide-lt960" style="flex:0 0 260px;position:sticky;top:104px;max-height:calc(100vh - 128px);overflow-y:auto"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A;padding:0 12px 8px">On this page</p>
<a class="x1" href="#t1" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">1. Using the Site</a>
<a class="x2" href="#t2" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">2. Our content</a>
<a class="x3" href="#t3" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">3. AI assistant</a>
<a class="x4" href="#t4" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">4. No professional advice</a>
<a class="x5" href="#t5" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">5. Pricing statements</a>
<a class="x6" href="#t6" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">6. Links</a>
<a class="x7" href="#t7" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">7. Privacy</a>
<a class="x8" href="#t8" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">8. Disclaimer</a>
<a class="x9" href="#t9" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">9. Limitation of liability</a>
<a class="x10" href="#t10" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">10. Law</a>
<a class="x11" href="#t11" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">11. Changes</a>
<a class="x12" href="#t12" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">12. Contact</a>
</nav></aside>
<article style="flex:1;min-width:0;max-width:760px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:48px">
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">These terms apply to your use of hazirminds.ai (the "Site"), operated by Hazirminds LLC, a North Carolina limited liability company. By using the Site, you agree to them. If you become a client, your Master Services Agreement governs our services.</p>
<section id="t1" aria-labelledby="t1-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t1-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">1. Using the Site</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">You may use the Site to learn about HazirMinds and contact us. You agree not to misuse it, including by trying to break its security, scraping it at scale, sending spam through its forms, or using it for anything unlawful.</p>
</section>

<section id="t2" aria-labelledby="t2-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t2-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">2. Our content</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">The Site's text, graphics, logos and design belong to HazirMinds or its licensors. You may view and share pages for your own information, but not copy, sell or reuse our content or brand without written permission. "HazirMinds" and our logo are our trademarks.</p>
</section>

<section id="t3" aria-labelledby="t3-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t3-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">3. AI assistant</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">The chat and voice assistant on the Site is an AI. It answers from information we've approved, but it can make mistakes. Its answers are general information, not a quote, contract or commitment; only a signed agreement binds us. Don't share sensitive personal information with it. <a href="/ai-disclosure">How we use AI</a></p>
</section>

<section id="t4" aria-labelledby="t4-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t4-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">4. No professional advice</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Content on the Site, including articles and examples, is general information about technology and business. It isn't legal, financial, tax or other professional advice. Results shown or described are examples, not guarantees.</p>
</section>

<section id="t5" aria-labelledby="t5-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t5-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">5. Pricing statements</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Prices, offers and the complimentary static website described on the Site are subject to a written proposal and our terms and conditions, and may change. Statements that our pricing is competitive compare us with typical market pricing for similar services and are not a guarantee about any specific competitor. <a href="/free-website-terms">Free Static Website Terms</a></p>
</section>

<section id="t6" aria-labelledby="t6-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t6-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">6. Links</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">The Site may link to other websites. We're not responsible for their content or privacy practices.</p>
</section>

<section id="t7" aria-labelledby="t7-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t7-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">7. Privacy</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Our Website <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> explains how we handle information you share through the Site.</p>
</section>

<section id="t8" aria-labelledby="t8-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t8-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">8. Disclaimer</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">The Site is provided "as is," without warranties of any kind. We don't promise it will always be available or error-free.</p>
</section>

<section id="t9" aria-labelledby="t9-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t9-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">9. Limitation of liability</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">To the fullest extent the law allows, HazirMinds isn't liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from your use of the Site, and our total liability for any claim about the Site is limited to US$100.</p>
</section>

<section id="t10" aria-labelledby="t10-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t10-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">10. Law</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">North Carolina law governs these terms. Disputes go to the state or federal courts in Wake County, North Carolina, unless the law where you live gives you the right to bring a claim locally.</p>
</section>

<section id="t11" aria-labelledby="t11-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t11-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">11. Changes</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We may update these terms by posting a new version on this page with a new effective date.</p>
</section>

<section id="t12" aria-labelledby="t12-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="t12-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">12. Contact</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633"><a href="mailto:contact@hazirminds.ai">contact@hazirminds.ai</a></p>
